  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.11 NHB DataCheck tool",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.11 “NHB DataCheck tool” means an online data screening tool provided by the department of environmental services and the natural heritage bureau of the department of natural and cultural resources where the public can screen for known locations of rare species and exemplary natural communities.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
